# Hexagonal architecture

Use .ai/skills/architecture-hexagonal as the complete reference.

## Dependency rule

Infrastructure -> Application -> Domain

- Domain never imports Application or Infrastructure.
- Application never imports Infrastructure.
- Infrastructure may import Application and Domain.
- A UseCase must not import another UseCase from another module.
- Business logic belongs in Domain or Application, never Infrastructure.

## Module shape

Use vertical business modules:

```text
src/[module]/domain
src/[module]/application
src/[module]/infrastructure
src/[module]/tests
```

Use ports before adapters. Use Factory for explicit wiring.
